    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/day-camp/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Day Camp Theme is designed for children’s camps, summer programs, youth activities, and educational organizations that encourage children to explore, learn, and grow through engaging experiences. It provides a structured layout suitable for displaying programs, schedules, staff profiles, testimonials, galleries, and registration information, making it easy to present activities, city-based events, and local programs in an organized way. The theme includes customizable homepage sections that allow administrators to organize content clearly and efficiently while also showcasing stories from past events, camp experiences, and children’s activities to build trust and engagement. The layout is responsive and adapts smoothly to mobile, tablet, and desktop devices, ensuring accessibility for parents and organizers on the go. It is built using the  Customizer, enabling users to modify colors, typography, and basic layout settings without editing code. The theme follows  coding standards and supports commonly used plugins for extended functionality. Day Camp Theme is suitable for camps, after-school programs, activity centers, and child-focused community organizations seeking a clean, responsive, and organized website structure that helps children explore new activities, share stories, and connect with programs within their city and beyond."
    },
